## Purpose

The owner requests a longer slanted fabric section, plausible visible supports,
a more reddish-pink colour and more stripes.

## Tasks

- [x] Preserve the current shared art, cloth geometry, styles and release inputs.
- [x] Generate a longer 1200x300 slope with forty rose/cream stripes and24scallops.
