## Acceptance criteria

- Slope length increases; the artwork is not simply a longer flat hanging hem.
- Forty narrower alternating#ce7183rose and cream stripes replace the former24.
- Metal hardware visibly connects wall plates to the projecting front bar and
  stays rigid while the fabric deforms.
- Main-page canopy is25%taller; entry keeps its complete building envelope while
  its sloped portion grows about23%. Deep scallops remain, without hiding signage.
- Preserve fixed rails, bounded cloth, idle stopping, exact static return and all escapes.
- No global recolouring, original-media changes, questions or image-tool views.

